        "abstract": "This article is the fifth article for the Standards Column in the new Reliability Magazine. This article summarizes the standards portfolio for the IEEE Reliability Society Standards Committee (IEEE RS-SC). This article describes the standards being created and maintained. This article showcases the first reliability prediction standard sponsored by the IEEE RS when the IEEE RS-SC began. This groundbreaking standard is IEEE 1413-1998, the IEEE Standard Framework for Reliability Prediction of Hardware. The guidance document that supports IEEE 1413–1998 is also discussed. The hierarchical diagram of the reliability standards portfolio is shown.",
